  key: firstArchives
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Well done - you have a knack for creative work! As I mentioned earlier, you'll
    be able to revise any works you'd like to remaster by visiting the Archives!
  - The Archives allow you to review any unlocked cards, as well as see your collection
    progress as a whole!
  - To review a particular card, just click on it - you can also use the arrow keys
    to view cards later in the deck.
  - Go check it out for yourself!
  outlineTag: Archives
